#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &kstars;"
msgstr "Kako dobiti &kstars;"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; is distributed with &kde; as part of the kdeedu \"Edutainment\" "
"module."
msgstr "&kstars; se distribuira s &KDE; sklopu kdeedu \"edutainment\" modula."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; is been packaged by many Linux/BSD distributions, including Fedora, "
"openSUSE, Ubuntu, and Mandriva. Some distributions package &kstars; as a "
"separate application, some just provide a kdeedu package, which includes "
"&kstars;."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; je bio pakiran u mnogim Linux / BSD distribucijama , uključujući i "
"Fedora, openSUSE, Ubuntu i Mandriva. Neke &kstars; distribucije paketa kao "
"zasebna aplikacija, neki samo podržavaju  kdeedu paket, koji uključuje "
"&kstars;."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you would like the latest Git development version of &kstars;, please "
"follow <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/Projects/Edu/KStars/"
"Building_KStars\">these instructions</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite najnoviju verziju razvoj Git od &kstars;, molimo slijedite <ulink "
"url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/Projects/Edu/KStars/Building_KStars\">these "
"instructions</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully run &kstars;, you need &kde; >=4.0 and &Qt;>=4.3."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi se uspješno pokrenuli  &kstars;, treba vam  &kde; >=4.0 and &Qt;"
">=4.3."

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To compile &kstars;, you will also have to have the following packages "
"installed:"
msgstr ""
"Za kompajliranje  &kstars;, također morate instalirati sljedeće pakete :"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "kdelibs-devel"
msgstr "kdelibs-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "qt-devel"
msgstr "qt-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "zlib-devel"
msgstr "zlib-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "fam-devel"
msgstr "fam-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "png-devel"
msgstr "png-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "jpeg-devel"
msgstr "jpeg-devel"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "cmake"
msgstr "cmake"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On my system, &kstars; uses about 60 MB of system memory with the default "
"settings. Most of this usage is due to the loaded object databases. You can "
"dramatically reduce the memory footprint by reducing the faint limit for "
"stars in the Configuration Window, or eliminating catalogs of objects (NGC, "
"IC, comets, asteroids, &etc;). If &kstars; is idling, it uses very little "
"<acronym>CPU</acronym>; but it will use as much as you have got when panning "
"or zooming."
msgstr ""
"Na mom sustavu, &kstars; koristi oko 60 MB memorije sustava sa zadanim "
"postavkama. Većina tog je zbog učitanih  objekata baze podataka. Možete "
"dramatično smanjiti količinu memorije smanjenjem tihi ograničenje za "
"zvijezde u prozoru za podešavanje ili uklanjanje kataloge objekata (NGC, IC, "
"komete, asteroidi, i sl). Ako &kstars; je u praznom hodu, koristi vrlo malo "
"<acronym>CPU</acronym>; ali to će se koristiti onoliko koliko ste dobili  "
"prilikom pomicanja ili zumiranje."

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr "Sastavljanje i instalacija"

#. Tag: sect1
#: install.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "&install.compile.documentation;"
msgstr "&install.compile.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this point, there are no special configuration options or requirements. "
"If &kstars; complains that there are missing data files, become <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> and manually copy all files in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">kstars/data/</filename> to <filename class="
"\"directory\">$(KDEDIR)/apps/kstars/</filename> (If you do not have "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> privileges, copy them to "
"<filename class=\"directory\">~/.kde/share/apps/kstars/.</filename>)"
msgstr ""
"U ovome trenutku, nema specijalnih opcija za konfiguraciju ili zahtjeva. "
"Ako  &kstars; da nedostaju neki fajlovi , postaviti <systemitem class="
"\"username\">korijen </systemitem> i ručno kopirati fajlove u  <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kstars/data/</filename> to <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$(KDEDIR)/apps/kstars/</filename> (ako nemate <systemitem class=\"username"
"\">korijen </systemitem> privileglije, kopriajte ih na  <filename class="
"\"directory\">~/.kde/share/apps/kstars/.</filename>)"
